%% RideLink Ride State Machine Lifecycle (Mermaid)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> REQUESTED: Passenger requests ride
    REQUESTED --> ASSIGNED: Available driver found & assigned
    REQUESTED --> CANCELLED: Passenger cancels before assignment
    ASSIGNED --> ACCEPTED: Driver accepts assignment
    ASSIGNED --> CANCELLED: Passenger cancels or timeout
    ACCEPTED --> IN_PROGRESS: Driver arrives & starts trip
    ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED: Driver or Passenger cancels before start
    IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED: Destination reached & trip concluded
    COMPLETED --> [*]: Payment calculated & receipt issued
    CANCELLED --> [*]: Termination
